### Scope and Constraints

This work targets the 1401+ slice of Chefaa’s product inventory, leveraging category pagination and product detail pages. The inventory references 130 page files, with documented gaps in specific ranges and occasional zero-result pages, requiring resilience in enumeration and reconciliation. The market context includes Egypt and Saudi Arabia, which is reflected in EGP and SAR pricing fields on product pages and impacts currency normalization for downstream analytics.[^3]

