### Auditability and Provenance

Each record preserves source_file, source_page, product_link, and extraction_timestamp. Exception logs capture failed links, missing fields, and anomalies (e.g., price conflicts). An audit trail supports reproducibility and clinical review.

## Output Specification and Delivery

The final dataset is serialized to data/overviews/medications_final/medications_overview_final.json. The JSON includes a metadata block and a deduplicated, normalized products array for 1401+, sorted by product_id. Integrity checksums are computed for delivery assurance.

